title: Lincoln Style Autofold Mirrors
raw_community_title: (2021-2023) Mirrors - Lincoln Autofold
category: Windows and Mirrors
platform: F-150
model_years: 2021-2023
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: 'Link for explanation of regular autofold vs Lincoln autofold https://www.f150forum.com/f129/forscan-14th-gen-f150s-481816/index51/#post6947182

  Note: the tradeoff of using Lincoln Autofold is that puddle lights won''t work'
warnings: Puddle lights will not illuminate when Lincoln style autofold is active.
steps:
- module: DDM
  address: 740-03-16
  mask: xxxx xxxx **--
  notes: click here for an explanation of regular autofold vs Lincoln autofold
  nibbles:
  - nibble: 8
    recommended_hex: '0'
    notes: click here for an explanation of regular autofold vs Lincoln autofold |
      Left factory (no data table)
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
  - nibble: 9
    recommended_hex: '1'
    notes: click here for an explanation of regular autofold vs Lincoln autofold |
      Left factory (no data table)
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
- module: PDM
  address: 741-03-16
  mask: xxxx xxxx **--
  notes: 'Note: the tradeoff of using Lincoln Autofold is that puddle lights won''t
    work'
  nibbles:
  - nibble: 8
    recommended_hex: '0'
    notes: 'Note: the tradeoff of using Lincoln Autofold is that puddle lights won''t
      work | Left factory (no data table)'
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
  - nibble: 9
    recommended_hex: '1'
    notes: 'Note: the tradeoff of using Lincoln Autofold is that puddle lights won''t
      work | Left factory (no data table)'
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Mirror_Folding_Cfg
      target_state: Ford,
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-01
  mask: xxxx xx*x xx--
  nibble: 6
  recommended_hex: A
  hex_offset: '+4'
  notes: Add 4 to current value to enable reverse tilt.
  feature_name: Mirrors Autofold (MA)
  target_state: MA Enabled
  bit: 3
  action: 1
